{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "note": "Merged-forward record (chat history card), drawn as Vue ForwardView draws it. Input is the core's forward content: {contentType: \"forward\", forward: {mode, title, items: [{sourceSenderName, sourceMessageTimeMs, plainText, content?}]}}; native hosts map it to FlareForwardContent {title, mode, items: [{senderName, sentAtMs, plainText, content}]}. mode 0 unspecified, 1 single, 2 merged. Preview text is given before visual truncation (one line, ellipsis).",
  "rules": {
    "layout": "No items → empty (forwardRecordEmpty). Exactly one item and mode not merged → single: the item's content drawn inline (its plainText as text when it has no content). Otherwise → card.",
    "card": "title = forward.title trimmed, else forwardRecordTitle. subtitle = forwardRecordTotal(count) when count > 1, else none. previews = the first 3 items as {sender, text}: sender = senderName trimmed, else forwardRecordUnknownSender; text = plainText read the way a text body's summary is read (trimmed, Markdown to plain text, emoji-pack keys in the reader's language), else the kit's one-line summary of the content, else previewForward. plainText is the words of the message that read the same in every language — the core writes it when it builds the record, with the conversation list's rules (a plugin card as \"[plugin name] summary\", never its data) and leaves it empty when only a word for the type would say what the message is; the kit never decodes it. more = forwardRecordMore(count − 3) when count > 3, else none. hint = forwardRecordViewDetails. The whole card is one button named \"{title}, {subtitle}\" (just the title without a subtitle). The card surface is `card`; in selectionMode it does not respond.",
    "drawer": "A tap opens the kit side drawer titled \"{title}{forwardRecordCountSuffix(count)}\" listing every item: the sender's initial (senderInitials: the first character of the sender's name, upper-cased; \"?\" without a name — never the first character of forwardRecordUnknownSender), the sender, the time (HH:mm on the same local day, else the month-day date and HH:mm, in the kit locale), the summary line, and for a content other than text the content drawn under it.",
    "plural": "forwardRecordTotal and forwardRecordMore take the plural one form in English (plural-vectors.json).",
    "palette": "The items are someone else's messages whoever forwarded the record: the single item drawn inline and every drawer row take the neutral palette of the surface they sit on (the record's card shell, the drawer), as an incoming message's content does — never the forwarder's outgoing bubble colours, for any content (rich text included)."
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "platforms": [
        "vue",
        "flutter",
        "ios",
        "compose"
      ],
      "input": {
        "contentType": "forward",
        "forward": {
          "mode": 2,
          "title": "",
          "items": []
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "layout": "empty",
        "text": {
          "zh": "暂无转发内容",
          "en": "No forwarded content"
        }
      }
    },
    {
